@startuml ISP_PetRescue
title ISP (por implementar) - Interfaces pequeñas para el contenido
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "App\\Contracts" {
  interface Flaggable {
    + flags() : MorphMany
    + isHidden() : bool
    + hideIfFlaggedEnough() : bool
    + restoreFromFlags() : void
  }
  interface Reviewable {
    + flagLabel() : string
    + flagUrl() : string
  }
  interface Shareable {
    + publicUrl() : string
    + shareLinks() : array
  }
  interface Geolocated {
    + latitude() : float
    + longitude() : float
  }
}

abstract class HasFlags <<trait>> {
  + flags() : MorphMany
  + isHidden() : bool
  + hideIfFlaggedEnough() : bool
  + restoreFromFlags() : void
}

class PetReport
class Post
class Comment
class PetProfile
class Business
class AlertZone

Flaggable <|.. PetReport
Reviewable <|.. PetReport
Shareable <|.. PetReport
Geolocated <|.. PetReport

Flaggable <|.. Post
Reviewable <|.. Post

Flaggable <|.. Comment
Reviewable <|.. Comment

Shareable <|.. PetProfile
Geolocated <|.. Business
Geolocated <|.. AlertZone

HasFlags <.. PetReport : use
HasFlags <.. Post : use
HasFlags <.. Comment : use

class FlagController {
  - flag(request, content : Flaggable, back, hidden)
}
class ContentHiddenNotification {
  + __construct(content : Reviewable)
}
class GeoDistance {
  + between(a : Geolocated, b : Geolocated) : float
}

FlagController ..> Flaggable
ContentHiddenNotification ..> Reviewable
GeoDistance ..> Geolocated

note bottom of Comment
  Un comentario no se comparte ni tiene
  ubicación: no se le obliga a implementar
  shareLinks() ni latitude().
end note
note right of FlagController
  Hoy recibe PetReport|Post|Comment
  (tipo unión). Con la interfaz basta
  con depender de Flaggable.
end note
@enduml
